{{Lua|Formatting}}
{{Main|Template:F}}
This template creates a fake template call in the form of how it would look in wikitext in source editor.

==Syntax==
See [[#Template Data|Template Data]] for extra functions.<br>
{{T|T|v1=Template Name|v2=v((#))=Variable Input|v3=p((#))=Fixed Input|v4=P((#))=Fixed Input with "let_parse" functionality|v5=Fixed Input|p6=_Y_=1}}
* Direct usage of named parameters is allowed but they will be displayed at a random order and always after any and all parameters with specified order, to specify an order please use {{F|p((#))}}, {{F|P((#))}} or {{F|v((#))}}
* Add <code>(())</code> around any string to give it variable formatting
* {{F|block}} &mdash; display the template code in block formatting
* {{F|NC}} &mdash; display the template code outside <<nowiki/>code> formatting
* {{F|let_parse}} &mdash; allow parsing of input as to allow for custom placed {{F|<nowiki><nowiki></nowiki>}} tags
* {{F|_Y_}} &mdash; include to automatically display the expected input with the parameters given
** {{F|no_joint}} &mdash; remove the '''yield:''' text from the string that joins the fake template call and the yield (removed by default on [[:Category:Infobox Templates|Infobox Templates]])
** {{F|_Ybr_}} &mdash; same functionality but adds a forced line break after the ''yields:'' for those templates that require to be on a line of their own.
** {{F|_Yn_}} &mdash; same functionality but adds a line break after the ''yields:'' for those templates that require to be on a line of their own but do not allow for artificial line break.
** {{F|_infobox}} &mdash; places template text after ''yields:'' instead of before. Also applies if template name includes the {{F|Infobox}} text.

==Examples==
;Without Parameters
{{T|T|sl}} yields: {{T|sl}}<br>
{{T|T|Notice/maintenance}} yields: {{T|Notice/maintenance}}

;With Parameter
{{T|T|sl|amazon}} yields: {{T|sl|amazon}}<br>
{{T|T|yt|abc1234}} yields: {{T|yt|abc1234}}

;With Multiple Parameters
{{T|T|p1=sl|p2=p1=amazon|p3=p2=12345}} yields: {{T|sl|p1=amazon|p2=12345}}<br>
{{T|T|p1=Nnd|p2=p1=sm37812606|p3=p2=IconWidth=19px}} yields: {{T|Nnd|p1=sm37812606|p2=IconWidth=19px}}

;Direct Usage Of Named Parameters
{{T|T|p1=SingerBox|p2=name=Relu|p3=image=Starpola relu.png}} yields: {{T|SingerBox|name=Relu|image=Starpola relu.png}}

;Custom Variable Formatting
{{T|T|Card|p2=p1=Xiao|P3=v2=(<nowiki>(equipped/e)</nowiki>)=weapon name}} yields: {{T|Card|p1=Xiao|v2=((equipped/e))=weapon name}}<br>
{{T|T|SingerBox|P2=P1=Akkiy|P3=image=(<nowiki>(imagefilename.png)</nowiki>)}} yields: {{T|SingerBox|P1=Akkiy|image=((imagefilename.png))}}

;Block Format
{{T|T|p1=Nnd|p2=p1=sm37812606|p3=p2=IconWidth=19px|p4=block=1}} yields:<br>{{T|Nnd|p1=sm37812606|IconWidth=19px|block=1}}<br>
{{T|T|p1=SingerBox|p2=p1=name=Amatsuki|p3=p2=image=Amatsuki-bokunoiro.onemanlive.png|p4=block=1|p5=_Y_=1}} yields:<br>{{T|SingerBox|p1=name=Amatsuki|p2=image=Amatsuki-bokunoiro.onemanlive.png|block=1|_Y_=1}}{{clr}}

;Infobox
{{T|T|p1=Terminology Infobox|p2=type=Documentations|p3=block=1|p4=_Y_=1}} yields:<br>{{T|Terminology Infobox|p1=type=Documentations|block=1|_Y_=1}}

